  "fullDescription": "This one’s for the gardener who is always the first to spot spring pushing through the soil. A weathered metal trowel with a wood handle sits planted in dark dirt, with three purple and lavender crocus blooms rising beside it on slender green stems. The hand drawn linework and soft shading give it a vintage botanical illustration feel rather than a flat clipart look.\n\nIt suits a garden tote, a potting shed sign, a seed packet label, or a tumbler for the potting bench. Perfect for anyone who counts down the days until crocus season, master gardeners, allotment owners, or a thoughtful gift for a mom who loves her flower beds. It also works well for spring markets and garden club merchandise.\n\nWhat’s Included\n– SVG file – fully scalable, ideal for cutting machines and design software\n– PNG file – high-resolution with transparent background, ready for sublimation and printing\n\nHow It Works\nThis is an instant digital download. Once your purchase is complete, your files are available immediately — no waiting, no shipping. Just download, open, and create!\n\nImportant Notes\n– Digital file only — no physical item will be mailed\n– SVG files work with Cricut Design Space, Silhouette Studio, Adobe Illustrator, Inkscape, and similar programs\n– PNG files can be used in most graphic design and sublimation software\n– Colors may vary slightly depending on your screen and printer setup",
